@startuml
left to right direction

node "VPS" {
  node ".NET Services" as dotNetServices {
    [Expense API] as ExpenseAPI
    [Income API] as IncomeAPI
    [KobSource API] as KobSourceAPI
    [IncomeSource API] as IncomeSourceAPI
    [ExpenseCategory API] as ExpenseCategoryAPI
    [IncomeCategory API] as IncomeCategoryAPI
    [Merchant API] as MerchantAPI
  }
  rectangle phpGateway
  node "Node.js Services" as nodeServices {
    [Log Service] as logService
    [User module] as userModule
    [Import service] as importService
  }
}

database "mongo database" as mongoDB
database "kobflow-Database" as kobflowDB
rectangle "react website" as webClient

phpGateway --> dotNetServices : grants access to
webClient --> dotNetServices : direct (transitional)
webClient --> phpGateway
webClient --> nodeServices

dotNetServices --> kobflowDB
logService --> kobflowDB
userModule --> mongoDB
importService --> mongoDB

note bottom of phpGateway
  Gateway rollout in progress —
  react website still calls
  .NET services directly in
  some cases
end note

@enduml